## Design System

| Element | Style |
|---------|-------|
| **Theme** | Dark mode primary, with option for light |
| **Primary Color** | Indigo/Violet gradient (`#6366f1` → `#8b5cf6`) |
| **Accent** | Cyan (`#06b6d4`) for active states |
| **Success** | Emerald (`#10b981`) |
| **Warning** | Amber (`#f59e0b`) |
| **Danger** | Rose (`#f43f5e`) |
| **Background** | Slate-900 (`#0f172a`) |
| **Cards** | Glass-morphism: `bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10` |
| **Font** | Inter (Google Fonts) |
| **Animations** | Fade-in, slide-up on mount; smooth hover transitions |

